---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pest Library | Identify Common Pests in Sudbury & Northern Ontario | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Identify common pests in Sudbury and Northern Ontario — rodents, ants, cockroaches, bed bugs, wasps, flies and more. See signs, risks and prevention tips for each."
permalink: /pest-library/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% set categoryOrder = ["Rodents", "Ants", "Cockroaches", "Bed Bugs, Fleas & Ticks", "Stinging Insects", "Flies & Mosquitoes", "Pantry & Fabric Pests", "Occasional Invaders"] %}
{% set total = collections.pestLibrary | length %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Pest Library</p>
    <h1>Pest Library</h1>
    <p class="lede">Not sure what you're dealing with? Search or browse {{ total }} common pests found in Sudbury and Northern Ontario — how to identify them, the signs to look for, and what they can cause.</p>
    <label class="pest-search" for="pest-search">
      {{ icon("search") }}
      <span class="visually-hidden">Search pests</span>
      <input type="search" id="pest-search" placeholder="Search pests, e.g. ant, mouse, wasp" autocomplete="off">
    </label>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight-top" data-pest-library>
  <div class="container">
    {% if site.pestLibraryDraft %}
    <div class="draft-notice">
      {{ icon("alert-triangle") }}
      <span>[DRAFT &ndash; REVIEW] Entries pending technician review before launch.</span>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="pest-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter pests by type">
      <button type="button" class="pest-filter is-active" data-pest-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All <span>{{ total }}</span></button>
      {% for cat in categoryOrder %}
      {% set count = collections.pestLibrary | inCategory(cat) | length %}
      <button type="button" class="pest-filter" data-pest-filter="{{ cat | slugify2 }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ cat }} <span>{{ count }}</span></button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="pest-results" data-pest-results aria-live="polite">Showing all {{ total }} pests</p>

    {% for cat in categoryOrder %}
    <div class="pest-group" data-pest-group="{{ cat | slugify2 }}">
      <h2 class="pest-group-title">{{ cat }}</h2>
      <div class="pest-grid">
        {% for item in collections.pestLibrary %}{% if item.data.category == cat %}
          {% include "partials/pest-card.njk" %}
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="pest-empty" data-pest-empty hidden>
      <h2>No pests match your search</h2>
      <p>Try another name, or describe what you're seeing and we'll help identify it.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/#quote">Ask Us to Identify It</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Not Sure What You're Seeing?</h2>
        <p>Describe the pest or send us a photo — a licensed local technician will help identify it and recommend next steps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/#quote">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-invert" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ icon("phone") }} Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
